Package: spaDesign
Type: Package
Title: Tools for sequencing-based spatial transcriptomics experimental design
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Juan", "Xie", email = "juanxie.84@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for simulating sequencing-based spatial transcriptomics data
 to facilitate experimental designs. Includes integration with Seurat, Shiny modules
 for interactive analysis, and utility functions for performance evaluation.
